    "scope": "Complete native_tum_joint_slac pipeline on the public development TUM fr1/xyz sequence: unchanged primary and replication windows, scalar and full-XYZ lattice ablations, two-sided pairs, reassociation, curvature, multistart, holdout, probes and saved reports. Three bounded native window processes preserve every depth pixel, sampled point, original evaluation population and per-window evaluation order. Whole-worker time includes child startup, imports, native factor transport, reconstruction and aggregation; optimizer, diagnostic and frontend totals are summed process time and may overlap; no accuracy or SOTA claim.",
